Survivors return dismayed --- Widows lament together --- Widows blame Shurpanakha lust for Rama --- Her provocation dooms Khara and Dushana --- Ravana abducts Sita and earns endless enmity --- Women list Rama killings from Viradha to Vali --- Ravana spurns Vibhishana righteous counsel --- Houses cry for slain sons brothers husbands --- No god or demon can shield them from Rama --- Forgotten boon loophole leaves men out, and Sita will devour rakshasas